 xes\, one per family. Saturday's Cookie Crawl runs 10 AM to 2 PM at partic
 ipating Chamber member shops\, and Sunday brings a Christmas Pickle Hunt w
 ith prizes. Time: Santa and Cookie Crawl box pickup 4:00 PM to 6:00 PM Nov
  13\; Cookie Crawl 10:00 AM to 2:00 PM Nov 14\; Christmas Pickle Hunt Nov 
 15 Host: Cullman Area Chamber of Commerce and Visitor Center Cost: Free
