DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261208
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261209
SUMMARY:Cullman Regional Lights of Love Ceremony
LOCATION:St. John's Evangelical Protestant Church\, Christ Hall\, 512 2nd A
 ve SE\, Cullman
DESCRIPTION:The Cullman Regional Foundation Dr. Herman C. Ensor Lights of L
 ove Ceremony is Tuesday\, Dec. 8 at 6 p.m. in Christ Hall at St. John's Ev
 angelical Protestant Church. Gifts of $20 or more place a light on the Cul
 lman Regional Christmas tree in honor or memory of someone\, with donation
 s received by Dec. 4 included in the ceremony. This year's program honors 
 hospice patients and retired surgeon Dr. Donald Marecle. Time: 6:00 PM Hos
 t: Cullman Regional Foundation Cost: Open to the public\; lights on the tr
 ee start at a $20 gift
URL:https://cullmantimes.com/2026/11/06/lights-of-love-ceremony-returns-dec
 -8/
CATEGORIES:Community and Fun
END:VEVENT
